    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aFive Nights And VTBs\u300bis a survival horror game that focuses on money management. Use only $100 per day to pushes ten VTBs\uff0cHow do you allocate gifts to each VTB and your own cost of living?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why did you ignore me in my liveing room\uff1f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113490/extras/b3b4a2d36d9bc611e49a02e9bc12e064.poster.avif?t=1729771904\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113490/extras/b3b4a2d36d9bc611e49a02e9bc12e064.webm?t=1729771904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Remember to pay for friendship to keep your love fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >I've graduated, and you're not going to watch VTB anymore, are you?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113490/extras/ebeb6d8216c3be63c920fb549eab5b60.poster.avif?t=1729771904\" width=300 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113490/extras/ebeb6d8216c3be63c920fb549eab5b60.webm?t=1729771904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113490/extras/ebeb6d8216c3be63c920fb549eab5b60.mp4?t=1729771904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember, she is always with you, Be mindful of your words and actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why? Why did you appear in other's broadcast room?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113490/extras/3787fba36dd265813a5a045405cd1d57.poster.avif?t=1729771904\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113490/extras/3787fba36dd265813a5a045405cd1d57.webm?t=1729771904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note that friendship between girls does not mean that they are willing to share your love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten cute VTBs with very different styles, but no less dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom levels. You can watch the live broadcast at a leisurely pace. You can also experience the tension of a bomb disposal expert</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >rouge mode. Gradually explore the dangers of VTBs by you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113490/extras/_%RHE_YDU_@_YJ550US3KH1.png?t=1729771904\" width=300 height=300 /></span></p>",
